      14/14 assertions, 6 PASS / 1 NOT_REACHED / 0 FAIL. The real P1 compiler + real
      shipped guard + real locator algebra + real R3 recorder + real R4 reader over a
      two-Member scene. driver=dry-node-fs, native=false — this is NOT the native
      `read` tool and NOT a Host. The >10MiB case prints NOT_REACHED with its reason.
  §3  node --test tests/a5sf-diag/a5sf-diag.test.mjs
      11/11 — the inherited R4 reader, unchanged, re-run at this head.
  §4  node --test tests/checks/{dist-placements,eslint-node-globals}.test.mjs -> 19/19
