  §7  node scripts/doc-checks.mjs               -> exit 0 (no output)
  §8  git diff --check: clean in the worktree AND across b126d87d8..HEAD (the branch's
      whole diff vs master) — the round-1 trailing-whitespace finding (C7) is gone.

